// RUN: %cx -typecheck --check-all %s 2>&1 | %FileCheck --allow-empty %s
// The standard library is fully typechecked under --check-all, so an empty
// program validates all of std. Diagnostics would reference std files, hence
// the global negative checks instead of file-scoped ones.
// CHECK-NOT: warning:
// CHECK-NOT: error:

void main() {
}
